<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <title>Printer Diagnostics</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
</head>
<body>
  <header class="topbar">
    <div>
      <strong>🍊 Orange Power Plant</strong>
      <span>Reception Printer Diagnostic Console</span>
    </div>
    <a href="/logout">Logout</a>
  </header>

  <main class="container">
    <section class="card">
      <h1>Printer Connection Test</h1>
      <p>
        This tool checks whether the reception printer can reach local diagnostic services.
        Due to plant policy, only <code>127.0.0.1</code> targets are allowed.
      </p>

      <form method="post" action="/test-connection" class="diagnostic-form">
        <label for="ipaddress">Diagnostic target</label>
        <input id="ipaddress" name="ipaddress" value="127.0.0.1:9100">

        <label for="testcommand">Printer test command</label>
        <textarea id="testcommand" name="testcommand" rows="5">status</textarea>

        <button type="submit">Run printer diagnostic</button>
      </form>
    </section>

    <section class="card muted">
      <h2>Operator note</h2>
      <p>
        After the last orange reactor incident, the printer team enabled a local-only test socket.
        The backup team also mentioned an internal Redis cache, but that system should not be reachable from the office network.
      </p>
    </section>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
